<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH SYNTHESIA PRELIMINARY 96 NET FALLS.</title>
<headline>CZECH SYNTHESIA PRELIMINARY 96 NET FALLS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech chemicals and explosives producer Synthesia a.s made a preliminary net profit of 22.6 million crowns in 1996, down sharply from 85.4 million crowns in 1995, its controlling shareholder Chemapol Group a.s. said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>  net profit (czk mln)	22.6	vs    85.4</p>
<p>  operating profit	   103.9	vs   609.9</p>
<p>  turnover		   5,081.1	vs 6,060.0</p>
<p>Note. Results figures were released by Chemapol Group</p>
<p>a.s. and are preliminary and unaudited.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
